Dead & Breakfast is a horror, comedy, music film directed by Matthew Leutwyler.

3
00:15:31,764 --> 00:15:37,764
Six friends on a road trip stop for the night at a bed and
breakfast in the sleepy town of Lovelock.

4
00:20:42,352 --> 00:20:48,352
After a night that leaves both the inn's owner and chef dead, the gang
finds themselves under suspicion by the local sheriff.

5
00:25:52,941 --> 00:25:58,941
But that's only the beginning as nearly all of the town's quirky residents become
possessed by an evil spirit and pin down the friends inside the B&B.

