01:02:07,058 --> 01:02:13,058
Dead & Breakfast is a 2004 musical zombie comedy film  directed by Matthew Leutwyler starring Ever
Carradine, Gina Philips, Erik Palladino, Bianca Lawson, Jeremy Sisto and Oz Perkins.

13
01:07:17,647 --> 01:07:23,647
The film premiered at the South by Southwest Film Festival
and went on to win over a dozen awards.

14
01:12:28,235 --> 01:12:34,235
It was also nominated for a Saturn Award.

15
01:17:38,823 --> 01:17:44,823
The film explores themes of gore, bed and breakfast (b&b), zombie.

16
01:22:49,411 --> 01:22:55,411
The tone is lighthearted and dark.
